{:*:} ID Engine is a simple programme who can use it for internet downloads.But sometimes
it will work incorrectly. However You can make your downloads fast and safely by ID Engine.

Follow this simple steps to use me :

	1. Copy (Ctrl + C) your download 'URL' from wed browser.
	2. Open the "ID Engine" shortcut on your PC desktop or start.
	3. The download 'URL' will add automatically to ID Engine.
	4. Click on 'Download' button'.
	5. After that ID Engine will provide you a dialogue box to save your file.
	   (if you want to change it, change name with file name extension.)

